data: {"id": "df028417f0b54ce8-final", "run_id": "df028417f0b54ce8", "seq": 482, "ts_ms": 1788766460822, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv` | ImagePullBackOff | 镜像仓库域名 registry.invalid 无法通过 DNS 解析（no such host），导致容器镜像拉取失败。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Error: ImagePullBackOff` (repeated) | 确认镜像拉取失败已进入重试/退避阶段 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Failed to pull image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\": ... failed to do request: Head \"https://registry.invalid/v2/...\": dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host` | 提供确切的 DNS 解析失败错误信息，直接指向域名不可达 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.status: Pending`, `container.restart_count: 0` | 证实 Pod 仍处于等待状态，尚未启动成功 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (`container=app`, `reason=ImagePullBackOff`): `1` | 独立量化确认当前处于 ImagePullBackOff 等待状态 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` (`container=app`): `0` | 排除因 CrashLoopBackOff 等应用错误导致的反复重启，确认问题停留在启动前阶段 |\n\n**证据说明**：\nKubernetes 事件（#1, #2）明确记录了镜像拉取失败的根本原因是 `registry.invalid` 域名无法通过 DNS 解析 (`no such host`)。Kubernetes 状态（#3）和 Prometheus 指标（#4, #5）相互印证，表明 Pod 自始至终未能成功启动（重启次数为 0），且目前仍处于因镜像拉取失败而导致的 `Pending` 和 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态，未发现其他异常维度（如 OOM 或 Crash）。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nDNS 解析失败 (lookup registry.invalid ... no such host) → 镜像拉取拒绝 (Head request failed) → 镜像拉取回退 (ImagePullBackOff) → Pod 处于 Pending 状态，业务不可用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为**镜像仓库域名不可达**。\n集群中的 DNS 服务无法解析目标镜像仓库域名 `registry.invalid`，导致 Kubernetes 调度器或 kubelet 在执行拉取操作时底层网络请求失败（`dial tcp: lookup ... no such host`），进而引发 `ErrImagePull` 并最终进入 `ImagePullBackOff` 等待状态 [证据 #2]。该结论得到了 Pod 状态 [证据 #3] 及等待原因指标 [证据 #4] 的交叉验证。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 51.6s\n├─ 问题定位: 15.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 27.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv: 27.2s (Evidence 22.3s, RCA 4.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv**: pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 51.567, "metrics": {"run_id": "df028417f0b54ce8", "mttr": {"value": "51.6s", "seconds": 51.56284546852112, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-imagepull-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 51562.84546852112, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 47819.37575340271, "tool_calls": 13, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 10, "failed_tool_calls": 3, "tool_duration_ms": 8724.663496017456, "to